Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi kids, I'm Qiqi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Qiqi Meets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the Little Prince~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the little prince saw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,five thousand roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,none of them were his.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he had spent so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,time with his own rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,meets a fox—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fox will teach him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,something even more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince walked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,under the apple trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A fox was sitting by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you... tame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tame?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,To tame means to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,build ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,little boy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you tame me—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your footsteps will sound like music,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:00:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,calling me out of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,my burrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,footsteps turning into
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,music? That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,sit a little far from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,come a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,sat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,On the first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.55,0:01:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he sat far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,On the second day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he came one step closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,On the third day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,closer still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Making friends
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,takes time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The color of the wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,fields reminds me of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.21,0:01:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your hair is golden,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and so is the wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I see the wheat,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel warm inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince touched
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,his golden hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you meet your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get closer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,little by little too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:01:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi and the little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,will... say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,see you tomorrow~ ⭐
